 "unsorted": {
  "job": "parts no reader could place yet; each is re-read and moved onto a node",
  "cats": [
   "other/other"
  ]
 },
 "placement": "each part sits on one node: its scale from the reader's level (primitive atom, component component, section section, page or shell page, effect or theme looks; logic and demo leave browsing), then the node at that scale whose cats hold its category, else the nearest scale. When nodes share a category, the first whose match words appear in the part's type or slots takes it; else the first without match words. Done in the app (src/lib/ontology.ts) when the index loads."
}